      "id": "8vvwaux",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "1. Meaning of Mineral Resources"
    },
    {
      "type": "keyFacts",
      "title": "Key Takeaways",
      "items": [
        "Minerals in India are broadly classified into metallic, non-metallic, and energy resources.",
        "Metallic minerals serve as raw material inputs for industrial, construction, and metallurgical applications.",
        "Energy resources such as coal and petroleum are concentrated in distinct geological formations and fields.",
        "India's mineral reserves are strategically distributed across well-defined mineral belts.",
        "Conservation and efficient utilization of mineral resources are critical for sustainable economic growth."
      ],
      "id": "yw39l5e"
    },
